<title>CHINA: China interbank market rates (CHIBOR) all higher.</title>
<headline>China interbank market rates (CHIBOR) all higher.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the China Interbank Offered Rate (CHIBOR) for Thursday issued by the official Xinhua news agency on behalf of the People's Bank of China, the central bank.</p>
<p>The figures represent weighted averages and not closing prices and are annual percentage rates.</p>
<p>		 1DAY   7DAY  20DAY  30DAY  60DAY  90DAY  120DAY</p>
<p> THURSDAY   11.268 11.448 11.784 11.604 11.880 12.449 no trade</p>
<p>WEDNESDAY  10.822 10.992 10.536 11.493 11.268 11.376 no trade</p>
<p>Turnover fell to 694 million yuan from 933 million yuan on Wednesday with the 20-day contract the most active.</p>
</text>
